          "tz": -360
        },
        "subject": "LU-12669 tests: force OSTCOUNT=6 for sanity-compr",
        "message": "LU-12669 tests: force OSTCOUNT=6 for sanity-compr\n\nIncrease OSTCOUNT to 6 in sanity-compr if it is lower so that it\nhas proper test coverage.  Otherwise, many subtests are skipped.\nChecking OSTCOUNT and skipping the whole test would be even worse.\n\nMany subtests could run on fewer OSTs, but that is for another patch.\n\nHopefully this will work for Janitor, since it only runs with\nOSTCOUNT=2 today.  Autotest already runs with OSTCOUNT=8.\n\nTest-Parameters: forjanitoronly trivial testlist=sanity-compr\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Iad7530b5102202598d652d2346a205ae9263c379\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
